  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using imagenet_vit_l image encoder with pca_n2000 RNA encoder achieves the highest validation accuracy (0.535) in singleprofile settings. This experiment tests whether multiprofile settings can benefit from the same image encoder and RNA encoder combination, using aggregation=avgpool (a promising aggregation method not yet tested with imagenet_vit_l) and fusion=concat (the superior fusion method in previous experiments). This clarifies whether multiprofile settings can leverage the best-performing components from singleprofile configurations, addressing key design decisions about profile settings and aggregation methods."
